ary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/4/Rodriguez11326-Main.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59636</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Defeat James Madison to Claim Sun Belt Conference Title</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/3/mens-soccer-mountaineers-defeat-james-madison-to-claim-sun-belt-conference-title</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/3/mens-soccer-mountaineers-defeat-james-madison-to-claim-sun-belt-conference-title</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Harry Hogben in action for WVU men's soccer against James Madison" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/3/110326_West_Virginia_79.JPG" /><br /><br />HARRISONBURG, Va. (Nov. 3, 2026) – The No. 9 West Virginia University men's soccer team defeated James Madison, 2-0, Tuesday evening at Sentara Park. With the victory, the Mountaineers claimed a share of the Sun Belt regular-season championship.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/3/110326_West_Virginia_79.JPG" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/3/110326_West_Virginia_79.JPG"><media:title>Harry Hogben in action for WVU men's soccer against James Madison</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/3/110326_West_Virginia_79.JPG" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 3 Nov 2026 22:23:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59635</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>